{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>日本MUJI全新氣墊式粉撲</p><p>無印良品新推出的粉撲採用高密度織物布料，不易吸收粉底液，觸感柔軟親膚，售價僅400日圓。這款粉撲的材質能有效阻隔粉底液過度滲透，避免浪費產品，使用時只需輕柔拍彈，無需用力按壓，即可將粉底均勻貼合肌膚。 從臉頰大面積上妝到鼻翼、眼下等細節位置都容易操作，能打造無厚重感、如蛋殼般光滑柔嫩的柔霧底妝。</p><p>粉底超服貼不卡粉</p><p>粉撲具適度彈性，能貼合肌膚均勻上妝，清潔方面可用粉撲專用清潔劑或中性洗潔劑清洗，沖洗乾淨後晾乾即可重複使用。 對於追求自然平整底妝的化妝控來說，這款平價粉撲絕對值得存進購物清單。</p><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/17922312219444322_414577286ad347365d37b.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179223122404781013_14501272226ad347385d804.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179223122610713151_20908506ad3473a600b0.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文 新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-17T10:19:14.593152+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":326,"images":3,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-17T10:00:27+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-17T10:57:40.722393+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-17T10:17:35.052302+00:00","content_hash":"7bff4d378a63ae92d806888ab0bb5842c0c8223d6399d0a09bcb0ec441ac270a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}